    "enUS": {
      "description": "This is a contract for the assassination of Magistrate Henry Maleb.  It was sealed and stamped in red wax, using a distinctive signet ring.",
      "dialogue": {
        "34faa45bf82b6094e431": "You look out of breath! Do you have something to report?",
        "d1ee8c874e6ee5c1add9": "<Maleb inspects the contract.>$B$BThat explains the latest attack on Southshore. The Syndicate must be after me, just as they were the last magistrate!"
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Assassin's Contract to Magistrate Maleb in Southshore.",
